 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-*   **Input:** A 3D spatial position $\mathbf{x} \in \mathbb{R}^3$ and a viewing direction $\mathbf{d}$.
-*   **Output:** Volume density $\sigma$ and directional emitted color $\mathbf{c}$.
